    <statement><p>Give a vector parametric equation for the line
through the point <m>\left(1,4,3\right)</m> that is parallel
to the line <m>\left\lt 2t-3,2t-4,t-4\right&gt;</m>:
<CENTER/></p>
<p><m>L(t)</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.
</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(1,4,3\right)+t\mathopen{}\left&lt;2,2,1\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
